    "commit_message": "Fix form and input element tree building regression (#388)\n\nTwo issues introduced during optimization work caused <input> elements\ninside <form> to not be placed as direct children of the form:\n\n1. insertForm was called with onStack=false in InBody state, so the form\n   element was never pushed onto the open elements stack. Subsequent\n   children were inserted under the wrong parent.\n\n2. <input> tags lost their explicit handling as void elements and fell\n   through to the generic insert path, causing them to be pushed onto\n   the stack instead of using insertEmpty.",
